      "en": "but Christ is faithful as a Son over his house. We are his house, if we hold fast our confidence and the glorying of our hope firm to the end.",
      "ko": "그리스도는 그의 집 맡은 아들로 충성하였으니 우리가 소망의 담대함과 자랑을 끝까지 견고히 잡으면 그의 집이라",
      "source_text_hash": "fc3c67d396184a0e4c3d59fb4d05fae8d2f6a19f4b2bdf427899cf0b056d1a0a",
      "translation_text_hash": "8b0dc5a29638b3f0b790cb0e031e77aed421c831e782118824e10e5bfa8ab9fa",
